      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dover_Beaches_North%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The original 1913 Route 35 road was later converted in 1961 into a southbound highway, leaving the old path for northbound traffic.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dover_Beaches_North%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Barnegat Peninsula, where Normandy Beach sits, stretches as a narrow barrier separating Barnegat Bay from the Atlantic Ocean.",
